e themself, taking %0.2f physical damage.\n\t\tIf the turn loss was caused by this effect then Fumble is removed.\n\t\tThe damage dealt increases with your Cunning.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的近程和远程攻击会让敌人难以集中精力于复杂的行动，在下一次使用技能时有 3%% 的几率失败，这一效果可以叠加，最多叠加至 %d%%。\n\t\t如果因任何原因，敌人技能使用失败，对方将弄伤自己，造成 %0.2f 物理伤害。\n\t\t如果敌人是因笨拙效果而技能使用失败，将会移除笨拙效果。\n\t\t伤害受灵巧加成。\n\t  "},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"576f1923f44aa048a8f6bcc3bd8d63f5c77478f22586f3dc6187ac8c215bde7b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d1574070f38691e2c6325de9217c334af8df4c3b46200124825d9cf266a0f54e","logical_entry_identity":"6ff6a894f0d60f62c738bd1eb0654f6f157f70d9a74d243e17902376f852e4d2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@Source@ has caused two threads to merge.","source_tag":"_t","target":"@Source@让两条时间线合并。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2d813bec2c8edeb3a24c94fa8cf087e97f14e3853964ffbc15b2f23d8909b70f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d15870a37242631c8a6acde449aba0009a5391a8efb68aa18e3dc66498089525","logical_entry_identity":"17d55029a50a6ce0568892d39e5266f82e6680a32bd2891c9d973851fe66a361","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is weakened and lost, all damage it does is reduced by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标迷失而虚弱，造成的所有伤害减少 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4dae4af5d15ef5343f2c57a66219e589adc46822e8b7e11e895a50a013173f93","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d15b123a6abafca6b1d91018ae271e123de6b12fcf32e30aac37ee5026f93fab","logical_entry_identity":"089710d0637e6a9d16c796962755444c85751c18389ac5b037bb84691df2f48f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"powerful ","source_tag":"entity name","target":"强大的"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4d2478a2d0c8e8d9343f9bd68f86ef8b79361660c6328c4691c55e3e85bb5849","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d15b8596aa1907406f28e347b740090a52a928f897c7d0905a315ad5e684b4a3","logical_entry_identity":"9048ae6858aa7f485875d7c14d7b6b08625f5eb4f66e8a96f4e70daccdd2e7ff","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"MINIONS: Perhaps you feel your Master has been lax or absent? Well, I shall amend that. I have been studying an object of great import. It is of much greater interest than your foolish unlives. But do not think that I will let you get away with things because of this.\n\nSkeletons, you have been getting noticeably behind in your adventurer slaughtering quotas. The next skeleton archer I see drinking coffee and chatting with the wights shall be rent limb from limb and fed to the orcs. Also, as a punishment for your general laxness, 1,000 skeletons shall be remanded down to Kor'Pul as punishment. A further 250 shall be slaughtered. These orders to be carried out by myself tomorrow at 3am.","source_tag":"_t","target":"奴才们：汝等也许觉得自己的主人近来懈怠或不见踪影？好吧，吾会纠正这一点。吾一直在研究一件至关重要的物品，它可比汝等愚蠢的不死性命有趣得多。但别以为吾会因此放任汝等胡作非为。\n\n骷髅们，汝等猎杀冒险者的数量已明显落后于指标。吾若再看见哪个骷髅射手边喝咖啡边与尸妖闲聊，就把它撕成碎片喂给兽人。此外，为惩罚汝等普遍的懈怠，吾将把一千名骷髅发配到卡·普尔，另行屠杀二百五十名。明日凌晨三点，吾将亲自执行这些命令。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b200940931dfee92eb7653bcac10341ccf5d23c1116c654e189f69a01749e0ed","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d1636f5bda12c04bd187df7b7b29060c642cf3303b9d87fb4c3ec0ec10bafdda","logical_entry_identity":"86628d9ff6f11e847711cda9698525e4febb9d3d27a169bdcfbea49b315d6833","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_RED#%s is dead, quest failed!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"#LIGHT_RED#%s 死了，任务失败了！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a9d04c315afe81f7426aff761ac3d3813945a070d0f20a14ae809e2bf1751957","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d168c6a66a01167eeb351664364f6db2468c3b048cde8d8664b9d813a73ad62d","logical_entry_identity":"2493919d8f2825c95a6864ceaee479f6d2e9ac809726e073fce3b02a27eda23e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Redfur Mustache 1","source_tag":"_t","target":"红色八字胡1"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"fec73269b4c07bedd1670e9f508212a83eef81a9f2bf8ddf786e34abd1bf9564","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d16ace09b3f3c9cb7b096a05e6e3f51d4c905c4a85e4af592b7335f3e8ac588b","logical_entry_identity":"71293785ea1269123a6aadc1a1b633342853cd6ebce570a40bf5d38bec7c012a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"%d%% chance to daze for %d turns","source_tag":"tformat","target":"%d%% 几率眩晕 %d 回合"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2bc8c8be5991be109bb1dc077e380c1ef393b872ee077919977ffd8041d71701","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d16dca6d9d46b17639b326af7c0f9cbc18d1c21c48db22ddef6406df594e6f58","logical_entry_identity":"b7bfa44a5e638859b3b0eb162817fc3984b48f0bfeb0adae1e32a4e8df34ba8b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sucker can dodge some.\n\nAs you know by now, the game was comparing your #LIGHT_GREEN#Accuracy#WHITE# to the orc's #LIGHT_GREEN#Defense#WHITE# to determine whether your blows landed. Evidently, the comparison did not go well for you.\n\nWhat is your #LIGHT_GREEN#Accuracy#WHITE#, and what is his #LIGHT_GREEN#Defense#WHITE#?\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"这家伙还挺能躲。\n\n你现在应该知道，游戏是通过比较你的 #LIGHT_GREEN#命中#WHITE# 和兽人的 #LIGHT_GREEN#闪避#WHITE# 来决定攻击是否命中。显然，比较的结果对你很不利。\n\n你的 #LIGHT_GREEN#命中#WHITE# 是多少，而他的 #LIGHT_GREEN#闪避#WHITE# 又是多少？\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1cf8e445c1d453bc705c0b41d10af0a107e543411850db22116b3df4fe07a2a1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d172e90753534b32615bd01466b85af9277aa18b6272e4e935800ae095266a8b","logical_entry_identity":"6db5cdca80765524c9bd59ebb9994af62649443de256c8a85b4708687b10fccd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sorcerers? I have never heard of them. There were rumours about a new master of the Pride, but it seems they have two.\nThank you for everything. You must continue your hunt now that you know what to look for.","source_tag":"_t","target":"法师会？我从来没听说过他们。传说部落有了一个新的领袖，看样子现在应该有两个。\n感谢你所做的事，你必须进一步搜寻更多的消息，你知道你该去做什么。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"95d9c5b353228ce16e72f39ff1d384e4785e72ab4dfdeb022d52661426599204","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"d1738a62e12a5d8380aca8be7bed99eb6af4c8addc0c7c3845d